# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SENSITIVE — never commit. Sessions, captures and secrets.
# All runtime data lives in .hound/ (profiles, runs, traces).
# The patterns below are defense in depth for anything that
# ends up outside it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Runtime data root (profiles, runs, downloads, traces)
.hound/

# Browser sessions: storage state, cookies, persistent user data dirs
**/profiles/
**/user-data*/
**/*storage-state*.json
**/*storageState*.json
**/*.session.json
**/cookies*.json
**/auth*.json
!**/tsconfig*.json

# Captures that embed cookies, tokens or private content
**/*.har
**/*.har.zip
**/trace*.zip
**/traces/
**/*.wacz
**/*.warc
**/*.warc.gz
**/downloads/
**/runs/
**/output/
**/screenshots/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.kdbx
.npmrc
.netrc

# Claude Code — personal / machine-local
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Playwright test artifacts
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/

# Dependencies & build
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store/
coverage/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
